  "Header": "UNT-ROA-V1.0",
  "Group": "Acquisition",
  "Category": "Media",
  "Description": "RADAR Object Acquisition: acquires RADAR Objects from the real world and provides them, and the Scene Descriptors of what it acquires where the Data Type exists. A RADAR sensor gives a Basic RADAR Object; a source on a disk or a network may give a Basic or a full RADAR Object, and Basic or full Scene Descriptors. Its Qualifier states the sensor, its calibration and its mounting pose.",
